sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant R as mcp-router
  participant Idx as SQLite index
  participant Cache as tools/list cache<br/>TTL 30m
  participant D as Downstream MCP

  Note over C,R: Client sees a small router surface<br/>not the full tools catalog

  C->>R: search_tools(query)
  R->>Idx: hybrid BM25 + vectors → RRF
  alt index / channels empty
    R->>Cache: get tools:{server}
    alt cache miss
      Cache->>D: tools/list
      D-->>Cache: tool defs
      Note over Cache: TTL 30m (default 1800s)
    end
    Cache-->>R: cached / live list
  end
  R-->>C: ranked matches

  C->>R: call_server_tool(server, tool, args)
  R->>D: tools/call
  D-->>R: result
  R-->>C: result

  Note over Idx,D: Indexing / probe: tools/list → Cache + SQLite
